ut it might not be what Tomoya is looking for. Megumi and Tomoya go on a date.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281275/4872728.jpg"},{"title":"Deciding the Night for Two","synopsis":"Tomoya leaves Kato in the middle of their date to meet up with Utaha. She takes him to a hotel, and they spend the night together. Alone…","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281275/4872729.jpg"},{"title":"Friend, Foe or a New Character","synopsis":"While Tomoya is preparing for the Summer Comiket, two familiar faces from his past show up. Will this affect his game and all the preparations?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281275/4872730.jpg"},{"title":"A Wingman`s Traumatic Recollection Mode","synopsis":"Megumi makes a concerted effort to understand dating sims. Later, Megumi and Tomoya assist Izumi during Summer Comiket.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281275/4872731.jpg"},{"title":"One-on-one Route After 8 Years","synopsis":"After Tomoya hurts Eriri's feelings by praising Izumi's book, Utaha and Megumi urge him to make up with her in order to keep their group together.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281275/4872732.jpg"},{"title":"A Melody of Reminiscing and Support","synopsis":"After an argument with her dad, Michiru runs away and decides to crash at Tomoya's place for a while. In the circle meeting, it is decided that background music is needed for the game. Will they find someone to help them out?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281275/4872733.jpg"},{"title":"Ready to Start Resolving the Subplots","synopsis":"Tomoya continues his attempts to recruit Michiru to his cause. Her critical words, however, cause Tomoya to question the dedication of his circle's members.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281275/4872734.jpg"},{"title":"The Ups and Downs at the End of Each Day","synopsis":"The group goes to see Icy Tail's first-ever concert. Before performing, Michiru's bandmates reveal a startling secret.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/281275/5168949.jpg"}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
